# Learning & SRS

## Session API (`api_learning.py`)

- `POST /learning/sessions` — `mode`: `learn`|`review`; `options.interaction_mode`: `typed`|`self_grade`; optional `smart_queue`, `queue_size`
- Flow: `next` → `answer` | `self-grade` | `hint` → `continue-round` → `finish`
- Also: `history`, `detail`, `weak-tags`, `stats/summary`, `explain`

## Progress (`services.py`)

- SM-2 style: `ease_factor`, `repetition`, `interval_days`, `next_due_at`
- Quality from correct/grade; fail resets rep; `recent_grades` window → difficulty bucket
- Queues: standard `build_learning_queue*`, smart mix via `SMART_QUEUE_WEIGHTS` in `learning_config.py`, self-grade full-deck queue

## Grading

1. Exact match (case-insensitive) / one-typo highlight — `answer_match.py`
2. Optional LLM grade — `learning_ai.grade_answer` if OpenRouter configured
3. Self-grade maps: known→correct/5, unsure→correct/3, forgot→incorrect/0

## Records

Persist attempts with `study_records.insert_study_record` and canonical `match_type`. Keep history/stats consistent when changing answer paths.

## Frontend

`pages/learning/session.vue` owns session UX; keep typed vs self-grade paths coherent with backend options.
